# basePath DesignNOR
// NOR

::Intro
@trigger    OnDesignSetupComplete
$set temp:hintGiven = 0
{@PAL} This Logic Gate is HI only if A and B are LO.

::Hints
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$if temp:hintGiven == 0
    {@PAL}  Hint: If A and B are LO, send HI. You can use transistors with two Gates.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 1
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 1
    {@PAL}  Hint: Use separate Gates for A HI and B HI to prevent Unstable signals.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 0
$endif